                <note rend="inline" type="source">760c.60m/11: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Commissioner at
                        Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Young</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-09-10T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 10,
                                1920—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>49. Your 132 [<hi rendition="#italic">134</hi>], September 3, 2 p.m. Department
                    agrees it would be unwise for you to act as member of Polish Lithuania frontier
                    conference.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
